# Hypha configuration — copy to `.env` and fill in what you need.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# EVERYTHING IS OPTIONAL. With no keys at all, Hypha still runs end to end:
# OpenAlex (free, no key) powers discovery + verification, and a deterministic
# offline reasoner writes the hypotheses. Keys unlock richer output.
# Variables already set in your shell take precedence over this file.

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LLM for hypothesis writing (optional). The first key found is auto-detected;
# without one, the deterministic fallback reasoner is used.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...            # or GOOGLE_API_KEY=...
# FIREWORKS_API_KEY=fw_...      # https://app.fireworks.ai/settings/users/api-keys
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=...
# GROQ_API_KEY=...

# Override the default model for whichever provider was detected.
# For Fireworks, use the full serverless id, e.g.:
# HYPHA_MODEL=accounts/fireworks/models/gpt-oss-120b
# HYPHA_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Verification evidence providers (optional). Used with `--verify`.
# Priority when multiple are set: Paperclip → Parallel → OpenAlex (free default).
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PARALLEL_API_KEY=...          # https://platform.parallel.ai  (Search API)
# PAPERCLIP_API_KEY=...         # https://paperclip.gxl.ai      (also: uv pip install gxl_paperclip)

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MeSH typing for --target (optional). Works without a key; an NCBI key just
# raises the rate limit (~3 req/s → ~10 req/s).
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NCBI_API_KEY=...              # https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/account/settings/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OpenAlex politeness + caching (optional).
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OpenAlex asks for a contact email to join the polite pool (faster, no key).
# OPENALEX_MAILTO=you@example.org

# Where Hypha caches API responses (default: ./.hypha_cache).
# HYPHA_CACHE_DIR=.hypha_cache
